    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Minister of Health under Section 32 of the Food Act, No. 26 of 1980 in consultation withthe Food Advisory Committee.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
